            "sid": "ISA 38:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalezonsuku uHezekiya wagula, waphos’ukufa. UIsaya umprofethi indodana kaAmozi wafika kuye wathi: INkosi ithi: Lungisa indlu yakho, ngoba uzakufa, kawuyikusila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.20.1+2KI.20.2+2KI.20.3+2KI.20.4+2KI.20.5+2KI.20.6+2KI.20.7+2KI.20.8+2KI.20.9+2KI.20.10+2KI.20.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kho 20:1–11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.32.24+2CH.32.25+2CH.32.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Lan 32:24–26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UHezekiya wasephenduka ekhangela emdulini, wakhuleka eNkosini, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "esithi: Nkosi, ake ukhumbule, ngiyakuncenga, ukuba ngihambe phambi kwakho ngobuqotho langenhliziyo epheleleyo, ngenza okulungileyo emehlweni akho. UHezekiya wakhala kakhulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwasekufika ilizwi leNkosi kuIsaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lisithi: Yana kuHezekiya uthi: Ithi iNkosi uNkulunkulu kaDavida ukhokho wakho: Ngiwuzwile umkhuleko wakho, ngabona lenyembezi zakho; ngizakwengezelela iminyaka elitshumi lanhlanu ekuphileni kwakho; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngizakukukhulula wena lalumuzi esandleni senkosi yaseAsiriya, ngiwuvikele lumuzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yilesi isibonakaliso kuwe esivela eNkosini esokuthi iNkosi izakukwenza lokhu ekuthembisileyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngizabuyisela emuva ngezinyathelo ezilitshumi umthunzi owenziwa yikukhothama kwelanga ezinyathelweni zikaAhazi. Ngakho ilanga laselibuyisela emuva ezinyathelweni zikaAhazi, inyathelo ezilitshumi elaselikhotheme ngazo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "La ngamazwi kaHezekiya inkosi yakoJuda emva kokusila kwakhe ekuguleni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UIsaya wayethe: Kabamthathele isigaqa somkhiwa, basifake ethumbeni, uzakusila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UHezekiya laye wayethe: Isibonakaliso yisiphi sokuthi ngizakuya ethempelini na?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
